{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:85837d9fe1cb952b","name":"Gunslinger Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-85837d9fe1cb952b","title":"Gunslinger Talent Tree","revision":18231,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:49:17Z","sha256":"49b524bd5005d1a6fbcde0091dcefef9a47d6eda900d5a7bb339a1d74850d2ec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18231","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gunslinger%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-85837d9fe1cb952b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You never travel anywhere without a blaster (or two), and you know how to handle yourself in a gunfight. The following Talents may only be used with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},". \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Debilitating Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," before making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you move the target character -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," if the attack deals damage. This Talent can be used only against characters, not objects or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Deceptive Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Select one target in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," within 6 squares. You can spend two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," on the same turn to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check; if the check result equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the target is denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against your attacks until the beginning of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Quick Draw"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you are carrying a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," (either in your hand or in a holster), you may draw the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," and make a single attack during a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", even if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},". If you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you may take any single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Action"}," of your choice, as normal.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knockdown Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," before making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", and the attack hits, you knock the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," in addition to dealing damage. You can't use this Talent to knock down targets two or more size categories bigger than you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Multiattack Proficiency (Pistols)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," as part of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"},", you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ranged Disarm"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," an opponent using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},". If your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ranged Disarm"]}," attack fails, your opponent doesn't get to make a free attack against you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Trigger Work"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You take no penalty on your attack roll when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blind Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You ignore the penalties on your ranged attack rolls when a target has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Damaging Disarm"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ranged Disarm"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," an opponent using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", the target also takes half damage from the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep Them Honest"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Careful Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Careful_Shot","referenceId":"reference:efcc94415279370b"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Suppress an Enemy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Suppress_an_Enemy"},", the enemy instead takes a -5 penalty to all attack rolls until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Lingering Debilitation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Debilitating Shot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you successfully use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Debilitating Shot"]}," to move a target character -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", the target suffers a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," requiring 4 hours of rest or a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to remove. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mobile Attack (Pistols)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Multiattack Proficiency (Pistols)"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Pistols)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Immediately after making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," where you attack with two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", you may move up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Pistol Duelist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a master of the elegant, if archaic, custom of dueling with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},". You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["End Game:"]}," You make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," against an opponent within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". The opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," is halved (rounded down) for the purpose of this attack."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Snap Aiming:"]}," You make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with the benefits of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Stand Ready:"]}," You gain a +4 bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn and make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ranged Flank"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"},", you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flanking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flanking"}," that target. You may only be considered to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flanking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flanking"}," a single target at a time. You must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on your turn to designate the target you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flank"}," at range.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Retreating Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When moving away from a pursuing target, if you either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Run","referenceId":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834"}," or use two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Actions"}," during this turn, you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with a -5 penalty as part of your move action. You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to avoid the penalty. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Slowing Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Debilitating Shot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you successfully use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Debilitating Shot"]},", until the target moves to the normal state on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," or until the end of the encounter, the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by 2 squares, and it loses its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},". These effects occur in addition to the effect of ",{"tag":"b","children":["Debilitating Shot"]},". If you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},", the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by 4 squares or half of its normal speed, whichever is the greater reduction. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Swift Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with a handheld weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". However, you cannot use your remaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," for an attack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
